#: ../../jlavi.rst:121
msgid "We set the node's flow limit in ``global`` and the HTTP request allowance in ``http``. The ``plugins`` map names the checks. Each frontend chooses which checks run. The two threads in ``hook_judges`` handle connection-stage agent calls, with room for 64 waiting connections. The console keeps its accounts and audit records in its own SQLite directory."
msgstr "我们在 ``global`` 中设置节点的流数上限，在 ``http`` 中设置 HTTP 请求配额。 ``plugins`` 映射表为各项检查命名，每个前端选择要执行的检查。 ``hook_judges`` 配置的两个线程负责在连接阶段调用代理，队列可以容纳 64 个等待的连接。控制台在自己的 SQLite 目录中保存账户和审计记录。"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:123
msgid "The value of ``http.policy_file`` names a JSON file. We save this policy as ``policy.json`` beside the module. It challenges requests by default and denies requests for the retired timetable. We run the commands from that directory so the relative paths resolve."
msgstr "``http.policy_file`` 的值是一个 JSON 文件名。我们将此策略保存为模块旁边的 ``policy.json`` 。默认情况下它会要求客户端完成挑战，并拒绝访问已停用的时刻表。我们在该目录中执行命令，以便正确解析相对路径。"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:125
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"default_action\": \"CHALLENGE\",\n"
"  \"rules\": [{ \"name\": \"retired\", \"path\": \"/retired/*\", \"action\": \"DENY\" }]\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"default_action\": \"CHALLENGE\",\n"
"  \"rules\": [{ \"name\": \"retired\", \"path\": \"/retired/*\", \"action\": \"DENY\" }]\n"
"}"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:132
msgid ""
"(umask 077 && openssl rand 32 > http.key)\n"
"mkdir -p console-data\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir console-data\n"
"sibuna check -f station.jlv\n"
"sibuna --config-file station.jlv"
msgstr ""
"(umask 077 && openssl rand 32 > http.key)\n"
"mkdir -p console-data\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir console-data\n"
"sibuna check -f station.jlv\n"
"sibuna --config-file station.jlv"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:140
msgid "We create the seed and administrator once. Each replica must answer ``GET /healthz`` and the staff agent must listen on ``staff.sock`` before it can admit staff connections. With Sibuna running, we can check readiness, inspect the pool and sign in at ``http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/``."
msgstr "我们只需创建一次种子和管理员账户。每个副本都必须响应 ``GET /healthz`` 。职员代理必须监听 ``staff.sock`` 才能批准职员连接。Sibuna 启动后，我们可以检查就绪状态、查看服务器池并登录 ``http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/`` 。"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:142
msgid ""
"curl http://127.0.0.1:9100/ready\n"
"sibuna ctl edge.sock show servers\n"
"sibuna ctl edge.sock show hooks"
msgstr ""
"curl http://127.0.0.1:9100/ready\n"
"sibuna ctl edge.sock show servers\n"
"sibuna ctl edge.sock show hooks"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:148
msgid "Route a browser and an RPC client"
msgstr "为浏览器和 RPC 客户端分配路由"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:151
msgid "This module uses a typed helper to name an origin. The public portal uses the shield. Calls under ``/orders.Orders/`` use an HTTP/2 pool and skip the browser firewall. The RPC service must authenticate its callers."
msgstr "这个模块使用带类型的辅助函数为源服务器命名。公共门户使用盾牌模式。 ``/orders.Orders/`` 下的调用使用 HTTP/2 池并跳过浏览器防火墙。RPC 服务必须验证调用方身份。"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:153
msgid ""
"fn service(name: Text, address: Text) -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    return { name: name, addr: address }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    return {\n"
"        global: { acme: { storage: \"certificates\", directory: \"letsencrypt-staging\" } },\n"
"        http: { surface: \"shield\" },\n"
"        frontends: { https: {\n"
"            binds: [\"0.0.0.0:443\"],\n"
"            tls: { auto: [\"portal.example.org\", \"orders.internal\"], http3: true },\n"
"            default_backend: \"portal\",\n"
"            routes: [{\n"
"                host: \"orders.internal\", path_prefix: \"/orders.Orders/\",\n"
"                backend: \"orders\", firewall: false,\n"
"            }],\n"
"        } },\n"
"        backends: {\n"
"            portal: { servers: [\"10.0.0.10:8080\"] },\n"
"            orders: { http_version: \"2\", servers: [service(\"rpc1\", \"10.0.0.11:50051\")] },\n"
"        },\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"fn service(name: Text, address: Text) -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    return { name: name, addr: address }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    return {\n"
"        global: { acme: { storage: \"certificates\", directory: \"letsencrypt-staging\" } },\n"
"        http: { surface: \"shield\" },\n"
"        frontends: { https: {\n"
"            binds: [\"0.0.0.0:443\"],\n"
"            tls: { auto: [\"portal.example.org\", \"orders.internal\"], http3: true },\n"
"            default_backend: \"portal\",\n"
"            routes: [{\n"
"                host: \"orders.internal\", path_prefix: \"/orders.Orders/\",\n"
"                backend: \"orders\", firewall: false,\n"
"            }],\n"
"        } },\n"
"        backends: {\n"
"            portal: { servers: [\"10.0.0.10:8080\"] },\n"
"            orders: { http_version: \"2\", servers: [service(\"rpc1\", \"10.0.0.11:50051\")] },\n"
"        },\n"
"    }\n"
"}"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:179
msgid "We replace the example names and addresses before deployment. For a public name the ACME authority must be able to validate our domain. For ``orders.internal`` Sibuna issues and renews the certificate locally. We install the local root certificate in each client's trust store."
msgstr "部署前请替换示例中的名称和地址。对于公共名称，ACME 签发机构必须能够验证我们的域名。对于 ``orders.internal`` ，Sibuna 在本地签发和续订证书。我们将本地根证书装入每个客户端的信任库。"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:181
msgid "Browsers can negotiate HTTP/2 over TCP or HTTP/3 over UDP on port 443. The portal pool uses the default HTTP/1.1 upstream. The orders pool selects HTTP/2 for gRPC trailers and streaming. For a public deployment we change the staging directory to ``\"letsencrypt\"`` after testing issuance. With an existing PEM bundle we replace ``auto`` with ``crt: \"portal.pem\"`` and supply the certificates and private keys for the names we serve."
msgstr "浏览器可以在端口 443 上协商使用基于 TCP 的 HTTP/2 或基于 UDP 的 HTTP/3。门户池使用默认的 HTTP/1.1 连接上游。订单池使用 HTTP/2 传输 gRPC 尾部字段和数据流。签发测试通过后，我们将测试目录改为 ``\"letsencrypt\"`` 以便公开部署。如果已有 PEM 文件包，我们把 ``auto`` 换成 ``crt: \"portal.pem\"`` ，并提供各服务域名的证书和私钥。"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:183
msgid "Relay a TCP service"
msgstr "转发 TCP 服务"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:186
msgid "Some clients speak a protocol of their own. We give the frontend and its pool the same protocol. This complete module relays a connection to one of two timetable feeds. The frontend limits new connections per source and the pool checks whether each feed accepts TCP connections."
msgstr "有些客户端使用自己的协议。我们为前端和池指定同一协议。这个完整的模块把每个连接转发给两个时刻表数据源之一。前端限制各来源的新建连接数，池检查每个数据源是否接受 TCP 连接。"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:188
msgid ""
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    return {\n"
"        frontends: { feed: {\n"
"            proto: \"tcp\", binds: [\"127.0.0.1:7000\"], default_backend: \"feeds\",\n"
"            rate_limit: { conn_per_10s: 200 },\n"
"        } },\n"
"        backends: { feeds: {\n"
"            mode: \"tcp\", health_check: { kind: \"tcp\" },\n"
"            servers: [\"127.0.0.1:7001\", \"127.0.0.1:7002\"],\n"
"        } },\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    return {\n"
"        frontends: { feed: {\n"
"            proto: \"tcp\", binds: [\"127.0.0.1:7000\"], default_backend: \"feeds\",\n"
"            rate_limit: { conn_per_10s: 200 },\n"
"        } },\n"
"        backends: { feeds: {\n"
"            mode: \"tcp\", health_check: { kind: \"tcp\" },\n"
"            servers: [\"127.0.0.1:7001\", \"127.0.0.1:7002\"],\n"
"        } },\n"
"    }\n"
"}"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:203
msgid "Share a UDP topology"
msgstr "共享 UDP 拓扑"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:206
msgid "Both nodes can use this module. In an empty directory we create mesh.key with 32 random bytes and copy it securely to the other node. Each node writes its own address and port from the nodes list into mesh.self. We run the check in that directory. The shared key authenticates peers, and accept_config lets them receive a cluster reload."
msgstr "两个节点可以使用同一模块。在空目录中创建包含 32 个随机字节的 mesh.key，并将其安全复制到另一节点。每个节点将 nodes 列表中自己的地址和端口写入 mesh.self。我们在该目录运行检查。共享密钥用于认证对端，accept_config 允许节点接收集群配置更新。"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:208
msgid ""
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    let peers = [\"10.20.0.11\", \"10.20.0.12\"]\n"
"    return {\n"
"        global: { admin_socket: \"edge.sock\", sticky_entries: 8192 },\n"
"        spill: { path: \"dns.spill\", size: \"1m\" },\n"
"        mesh: {\n"
"            nodes: [for peer in peers: \"${peer}:7946\"],\n"
"            self_file: \"mesh.self\",\n"
"            key_file: \"mesh.key\",\n"
"            accept_config: true, forward: {},\n"
"        },\n"
"        frontends: { dns: {\n"
"            proto: \"udp\", binds: [\"127.0.0.1:15353\"], default_backend: \"resolvers\",\n"
"            udp_defense: { mode: \"rate_limit\", threshold_pps: 200 },\n"
"        } },\n"
"        backends: { resolvers: {\n"
"            mode: \"udp\", sticky: \"table\", max_flows_scope: \"fleet\",\n"
"            servers: [\n"
"                { name: \"east\", addr: \"10.20.0.53:53\", max_flows: 300 },\n"
"                { name: \"west\", addr: \"10.20.0.54:53\", max_flows: 300 },\n"
"            ],\n"
"        } },\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    let peers = [\"10.20.0.11\", \"10.20.0.12\"]\n"
"    return {\n"
"        global: { admin_socket: \"edge.sock\", sticky_entries: 8192 },\n"
"        spill: { path: \"dns.spill\", size: \"1m\" },\n"
"        mesh: {\n"
"            nodes: [for peer in peers: \"${peer}:7946\"],\n"
"            self_file: \"mesh.self\",\n"
"            key_file: \"mesh.key\",\n"
"            accept_config: true, forward: {},\n"
"        },\n"
"        frontends: { dns: {\n"
"            proto: \"udp\", binds: [\"127.0.0.1:15353\"], default_backend: \"resolvers\",\n"
"            udp_defense: { mode: \"rate_limit\", threshold_pps: 200 },\n"
"        } },\n"
"        backends: { resolvers: {\n"
"            mode: \"udp\", sticky: \"table\", max_flows_scope: \"fleet\",\n"
"            servers: [\n"
"                { name: \"east\", addr: \"10.20.0.53:53\", max_flows: 300 },\n"
"                { name: \"west\", addr: \"10.20.0.54:53\", max_flows: 300 },\n"
"            ],\n"
"        } },\n"
"    }\n"
"}"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:235
msgid "We run the first command on one node only. On the second node we use the same key and put 10.20.0.12:7946 in mesh.self. Each DNS listener serves clients on its own loopback interface."
msgstr "第一条命令只在一个节点运行。第二个节点使用同一密钥，并在 mesh.self 中写入 10.20.0.12:7946。每个节点只在自己的回环接口上接收 DNS 请求。"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:237
msgid ""
"(umask 077 && openssl rand 32 > mesh.key)\n"
"printf '%s\\n' '10.20.0.11:7946' > mesh.self"
msgstr ""
"(umask 077 && openssl rand 32 > mesh.key)\n"
"printf '%s\\n' '10.20.0.11:7946' > mesh.self"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:242
msgid "The pool remembers a client's resolver. Each node keeps its own spill file for recovering choices after a restart. The mesh shares choices and the per-server flow allowance. We allow UDP port 7946 and the forwarding port 7947 (TCP and UDP) between peers. After starting both nodes we can compare their revisions with ``sibuna ctl edge.sock show cluster``."
msgstr "池会记住客户端使用的解析器。每个节点维护自己的溢出文件，以便重启后恢复分配结果。网格共享这些分配结果和每台服务器的流配额。我们在对等节点之间开放 UDP 端口 7946 和转发端口 7947（TCP 和 UDP）。启动两个节点后，可以用 ``sibuna ctl edge.sock show cluster`` 比较它们的修订版本。"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:244
msgid "Publish routes from a database"
msgstr "从数据库发布路由"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:247
msgid "For a versioned topology we keep two modules. We use the first timetable example as ``edge.jlv``. Its ``frontends``, ``backends`` and ``http`` are the published revision. We save the following host settings as ``node.jlv``. The bind override lets this node serve the published web frontend on port 8180."
msgstr "要为拓扑管理版本，我们使用两个模块。第一个时刻表示例就是 ``edge.jlv`` 。其中的 ``frontends`` 、 ``backends`` 和 ``http`` 构成发布的版本。我们将下面的主机设置保存为 ``node.jlv`` 。通过覆盖监听地址，该节点可在端口 8180 提供已发布的 Web 前端。"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:249
msgid ""
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    return {\n"
"        global: { admin_socket: \"edge.sock\" },\n"
"        authority: {\n"
"            sqlite: \"authority.db\", node: \"station-1\", poll: \"5s\",\n"
"            cache: \"authority.cache\", binds: { web: [\"127.0.0.1:8180\"] },\n"
"        },\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    return {\n"
"        global: { admin_socket: \"edge.sock\" },\n"
"        authority: {\n"
"            sqlite: \"authority.db\", node: \"station-1\", poll: \"5s\",\n"
"            cache: \"authority.cache\", binds: { web: [\"127.0.0.1:8180\"] },\n"
"        },\n"
"    }\n"
"}"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:261
msgid ""
"sibuna authority apply -c node.jlv -f edge.jlv --expect 0 --note \"first timetable\"\n"
"sibuna authority history -c node.jlv\n"
"sibuna --config-file node.jlv"
msgstr ""
"sibuna authority apply -c node.jlv -f edge.jlv --expect 0 --note \"first timetable\"\n"
"sibuna authority history -c node.jlv\n"
"sibuna --config-file node.jlv"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:267
msgid "This example uses a build with SQLite support. We use revision zero only for a new database. Before the next change we run ``sibuna authority diff -c node.jlv -f edge.jlv`` and apply against the revision we reviewed. SQLite serves one host. With PostgreSQL support we can serve a fleet. We replace ``sqlite`` with ``postgres_url_file`` pointing to a protected file containing the PostgreSQL connection URL. Each host supplies its own node name and bind overrides."
msgstr "本例使用支持 SQLite 的构建版本。只有新数据库才从版本零开始。下次修改前，我们运行 ``sibuna authority diff -c node.jlv -f edge.jlv`` 查看差异，再以审阅过的版本为基准提交。SQLite 适用于单台主机。启用 PostgreSQL 后可管理多台主机。我们将 ``sqlite`` 替换为 ``postgres_url_file`` ，指向含有 PostgreSQL 连接 URL 的受保护文件。每台主机分别指定节点名和要覆盖的监听地址。"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:269
msgid "Evaluation and diagnostics"
msgstr "求值与诊断"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:272
msgid "Sibuna exposes the pure ``jlv.std.foundation`` library. Helpers live in the same module. Deployment resources, filesystem operations and imports from neighbouring files are outside this interface. Source and resulting JSON each have a 256 KiB limit. Evaluation has a budget of one million steps."
msgstr "Sibuna 提供纯函数库 ``jlv.std.foundation`` 。辅助函数放在同一模块内。此接口不提供部署资源、文件系统操作或从相邻文件导入模块的功能。源文件和生成的 JSON 各限 256 KiB，求值预算为一百万步。"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:274
msgid "If the compiler reports an unknown name, we check its spelling and type at the reported line and column. If validation reports an unknown backend, we check that the route names a pool in the returned map. A rejected reload keeps the previous routing configuration."
msgstr "若编译器报告未知名称，就在给出的行和列检查拼写和类型。若验证阶段报告未知后端，应确认路由引用的池存在于返回的映射中。重新加载遭拒时，先前的路由配置继续生效。"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:276
msgid "Where to configure each part"
msgstr "各部分在哪里配置"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:279
msgid "The following sections give the supported options, defaults and restart rules. A map in an operations example belongs at the same position in the value returned by ``edge()``. A quoted JSON field such as ``\"max_flows\": 4096`` can be written as ``max_flows: 4096`` in Jlavi."
msgstr "下表列出各选项、默认值和重启条件的说明。运维示例中的映射表可以放在 ``edge()`` 返回值的同一位置。JSON 中带引号的字段如 ``\"max_flows\": 4096`` 在 Jlavi 中可以写成 ``max_flows: 4096`` 。"

